HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The OpenBSM implementation was created by McAfee Research, the security
     division of McAfee Inc., under contract to Apple Computer, Inc., in 2004.
     It was subsequently adopted by the TrustedBSD Project as the foundation
     for the OpenBSM distribution.

     The aauu__pprriinntt__ffllaaggss__ttookk() function was added by Stacey Son as a replace‐
     ment for the aauu__pprriinntt__ttookk() so new output formatting flags can be easily
     added without changing the API.  The aauu__pprriinntt__ttookk() is obsolete but re‐
     mains in the API to support legacy code.

